", "active": 1, "footnote": "還有1個選擇本房的理由", "data": [{"id": 1, "name": "產權有保障", "text": "已在地政局辦理建物產權登記，選擇更安心", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_01.png"}, {"id": 2, "name": "屋主直租", "text": "屋主本人發佈，減少中間人干預，無需服務費", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_02.png"}, {"id": 3, "name": "拎包入住", "text": "滿足90%的日常所需設備，享輕鬆入住體驗", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_03.png"}, {"id": 6, "name": "租金低", "text": "比同社區同格局的房屋，租金低約1000元", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_06.png"}]}, "remark": {"title": "屋主說", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;🏠&nbsp;無印居家風套房&nbsp;<br><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【類型】</strong></span>電梯華廈8樓，獨立套房<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【坪數】</strong></span>10坪<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【租金】</strong></span>16,000元（含網路、水及管理費）<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【電費】</strong></span>獨立電錶，一度7元<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【家具】</strong></span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①&nbsp;雙人床墊　②&nbsp;雙人掀床架　③&nbsp;單門冰箱<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④&nbsp;茶几　⑤&nbsp;大衣櫃&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑥&nbsp;獨立鞋櫃<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑦&nbsp;儲熱型熱水器　⑧分離式冷氣&nbsp;　⑨&nbsp;42吋液晶大電視<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【優勢】</strong></span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1、全天24小時走廊、門外紅外線監控管理。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2、大樓附設管理室，進出有保障，亦可代收包裹。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3、社區附垃圾桶及資源回收站，免等垃圾車。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4、免費ADSL光纖高速網路、免費用水。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5、免費使用洗衣機和飲水機（專人定期保養）。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6、公共區域專人定期打掃，居住環境佳。<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7、高品質配備家具，室內採光佳。<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【交通及生活機能】</strong></span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1、步行1分鐘到「公車站牌－藍31、604、651、667等」<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2、步行3分鐘到「美聯社、傳統早市、全家便利商店」<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3、步行6分鐘到「重慶國小、國慶傳統市場」<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4、騎車5分鐘到「亞東捷運站、亞東醫院」<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5、騎車10分鐘到「府中、板橋捷運站和公車站」<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6、對面有公園和遊樂場，可調劑身心<br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【住戶條件限制】</strong></span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>歡迎「單純的上班族」或「學生」租用（2人合住亦可）</strong></span><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>因房東要求生活品質，住戶皆經篩選，工作正當且優質<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>🚫禁止抽菸&nbsp;🚫禁止養寵物，可能影響其他房客生活者勿試‼️</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>【預約看屋】</strong></span><strong><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;時段：</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 153, 0);\"><strong>平假日&nbsp;白天下午或晚上時段</strong></span><strong><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;方式：來電洽詢&nbsp;</strong><br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>備註：<u>看房請攜帶名片、工作證或學生證‼️</u></strong></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "大順全家福 板橋區廣權路", "lat": "24.9907844", "lng": "121.4618427", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "廣福公園站", "distance": 102, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約102公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "干城路口站", "distance": 197, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約197公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "看守所站", "distance": 237, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約237公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "家嘉樂塑膠五金百貨", "distance": 840, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約840公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "Bistro 206", "distance": 78, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約78公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市土城區安和國民小學", "distance": 377, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約377公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立重慶國民中學", "distance": 820, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約820公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "15,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "1度7元", "key": "ele